# What never goes into an image. The build context is the repository root, so
# these patterns cover backend/ and frontend/ alike.

# Secrets. Configuration reaches a container through its environment, never
# through a file baked into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Database dumps and backups — real data.
**/*.sql
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.dump
db_backups/

# Rebuilt inside the image, or never needed there.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
frontend/dist

# Repository and editor clutter.
.git
.vscode
.idea
**/*.log
docs/
